<section>
  <h2>Project Overview</h2>
  <p>
    Silico Guard is a fire safety innovation project focused on silicone-based
    fire blanket concepts designed to support fire response and personal protection.
  </p>

  <p>
    The project includes two concepts: a silicone fire blanket and a
    silicone fire blanket incorporating a cooling gel layer.
  </p>
</section>

<section>
  <h2>Project Concept</h2>
  <p>
    The project explores the use of silicone as a flexible, heat-resistant
    and electrically insulating material within a fire safety application.
  </p>

  <p>
    The second concept incorporates a cooling layer as part of the design
    approach to reduce the sensation of heat during use.
  </p>
</section>

<section>
  <h2>Design & Development</h2>
  <p>
    The project concepts were developed using 3D modeling and physical
    prototyping, followed by a practical demonstration.
  </p>

